── What this repository contains ──

This repository holds the MCP server manifest (server.json), documentation,
and response examples for den. It does NOT contain the den knowledge graph,
the serving code, or any standards text corpus. Those are not published here.

The manifest points at a hosted endpoint (https://mcp.den.archi/mcp) that
requires authorization. Copying this repository does not grant access to it.

